From f2f9bd473c8d08ed59944d3928402b428f5754f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henrique Kalke <henriquekalke@icloud.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 17:08:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: demo bank playground with skippable due diligence

Add /playground/bank routes, BFF client helpers, DEMO badge, welcome
$10,000 bootstrap flow, and optional PDE document steps with skip.
Wire sibling e-bank-api into Makefile up/down.
